===== Installation =====
  - -> [[:downloads]]
  - -> [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.flashing|Install OpenWrt (generic explanation)]]

  * Recommended to make a backup of the whole flash before starting, specially the "boot params" partition as it has the calibration info for wireless to work and the base MAC addres.
  * This device comes from factory with [[docs:techref:bootloader:brnboot]] as bootloader. It can be used to load u-boot via uart and the xmodem protocol to ram, as a second stage bootloader.
  * Use target Lantiq GPON/XWAY, subtarget Danube, target profile ARV4518PWR01 or ARV4518PWR01A.

==== Flash Layout ====
Please check out the article [[docs:techref:flash.layout|The OpenWrt Flash Layout]]. It contains an example and a couple of explanations.

